@*
    A parent for tests that bind to a local: the test class is not a component, so a change callback
    re-renders nothing by itself. Rerender() plays the parent's render, which hands the children
    whatever the bound local holds by then.
*@
@ChildContent

@code {
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }

    public Task Rerender() => InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
}
